<title>UK: Morgan Stanley sets warrants on the S&amp;P 500 index.</title>
<headline>Morgan Stanley sets warrants on the S&amp;P 500 index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley (Jersey) Ltd has issued 25 million American-style call and put warrants, in seven tranches (each call tranches is four million warrants and each put tranche is three million warrants), on the S&amp;P 500 index,</p>
<p>lead manager Morgan Stanley &amp; Co International Ltd said.</p>
<p> WARRANTS     STRIKE     ISS PRICE	PREMIUM	GEARING</p>
<p> CALL A	 725	  $84.50	    9.16 PCT	8.8 TIMES</p>
<p> PUT B	  725	  $40.60	    7.71 PCT     18.3 TIMES</p>
<p> CALL C	 750	  $69.20	   10.46 PCT     10.7 TIMES</p>
<p> PUT D	  750	  $49.70	    5.57 PCT     14.9 TIMES</p>
<p> CALL E	 800	  $44.60	   13.89 PCT     16.6 TIMES</p>
<p> PUT F	  800	  $75.50	    2.31 PCT	9.8 TIMES</p>
<p> CALL G	 850	  $25.40	   18.04 PCT     29.2 TIMES</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   26.FEB.98		 PAYDATE	06.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUXEMBOURG		MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  741.6</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
